# The mid-week reading. NOT optional housekeeping: the 2014-2024 archive holds only two snapshots per game, so it can never show WHEN post-freeze drift happens. This is the only source of the time profile (PICKEM_MODEL.md 5j round 6d).
# Moved 12:00 -> 12:35 on 2026-09-09 for the same reason as lock-sun: 12:00 preceded the 12:20 collection, so every 'Friday midweek' reading was really Thursday 23:20. That is fatal here specifically -- this snapshot's ONLY purpose is the time profile of drift, and a time profile built from timestamps offset backwards by 12h40m measures nothing.
[Unit]
Description=Pick'em capture: midweek
[Timer]
Unit=pickem-capture@midweek.service
OnCalendar=Fri *-*-* 12:35:00 America/New_York
RandomizedDelaySec=120
Persistent=true
[Install]
WantedBy=timers.target
